{
    "prompt": "Write a behavior tree for the robot to execute the command using only available nodes. If object is visible, move and take it, then process its properties. Perform specific task if conditions met, otherwise scan the area. list of available nodes: <Action ID = MoveTowardsObject    /> <Action ID = TakeObject    /> <Action ID = ProcessObjectProperties    /> <Action ID = ScanAreaForObjects    /> <Action ID = PerformTask    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectVisible    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectWithinRange    /> <Condition ID = IsTaskSpecificConditionMet    /> <SubTree ID = MobileRobotTask    />",
